"Create a full content-type header given a content-type or extension. When"
" given an extension, `mime.lookup` is used to get the matching content-"
"type, otherwise the given content-type is used. Then if the content-type "
"does not already have a `charset` parameter, `mime.charset` is used to "
"get the default charset and add to the returned content-type."
